comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-18T13:11:08.559Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete strict all-status inventory of 2776 items and exact 26.6.1 CLI search found no existing owner. Read completed pm-7ej0mh as prior compatible refresh lineage. TypeScript 7, Vitest 5 and npm-package-arg 14 retain their existing migration owners pm-do5b, pm-fokyhh and pm-ksr40d."
  "2026-09-18T13:17:36.922Z","harness:codex","Updated development declarations to @types/node 26.6.1 while preserving dependencies >=22 and runtime engines >=22.18.0. Other available major updates remain under existing migration owners because TypeScript 7 exceeds typescript-eslint peer support, Vitest 5 exceeds CodSpeed peer support, and npm-package-arg 14 raises the engine floor. Refreshed the complete dependency installation before validation."
  "2026-09-18T13:26:33.848Z","harness:codex","Dependency audit after lockfile refresh reports zero vulnerabilities across 364 dependencies. The published 2026.9.18 artifact passed exact-version npm/Bun installed-agent acceptance (11 lifecycle and SDK steps per manager) and public npx/bunx CLI, stdio MCP, HTTP MCP, Skills, Apps, bin coverage, and missing-bin negative controls. This verifies the existing release; it does not claim this branch is published."
  "2026-09-18T13:33:12.253Z","harness:codex","Release verification: latest successful Auto Release run 35346366266 retained the existing immutable v2026.9.18 tag. Public npm/Bun/executor verification passed without publishing another version. Main protection retains 26 strict required check contexts. Existing release authorization intentionally permits the maintainer release push; changing that mechanism requires preserving the reviewed publisher design."
  "2026-09-18T13:59:36.838Z","harness:codex","Pre-submission GitHub refresh: no open PRs and no open Dependabot, code-scanning, or secret-scanning alerts. Both open GitHub issues already carry canonical PM-item link comments. No new duplicate intake was created. Latest package doctor deep inspection passed with pm-changelog 2026.9.18."
  "2026-09-18T14:04:15.105Z","harness:codex","Final local validation passed: 708 files / 9006 tests; exact coverage 64834/64834 statements, 49486/49486 branches, 13456/13456 functions, 62056/62056 lines. No threshold reductions or coverage exclusions were introduced. Full static-quality chain, linked tests, typecheck, 89-command dogfood, packed npm/npx/bunx, installed first-run/MCP/telemetry, docs, and security checks passed. Implementation complete; hosted review and merge are the remaining delivery steps."
